  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Chargeable Weight Calculator"
 },
 "description": "Calculate air freight chargeable weight \u2014 the greater of actual gross weight and volumetric weight, which is what airlines bill. Volumetric weight (kg) = (L x W x H in cm) / divisor; the IATA-standard divisor is 6,000 (1 CBM = 166.67 kg), while express integrators (DHL, FedEx, UPS) typically use 5,000.\n\nBehavior: deterministic; per-piece volumetric weight is rounded to 2 decimal places before totalling; basis reports which weight governs (\"volumetric\" = cargo is light for its size, \"actual\" = dense). Air mode only \u2014 sea W/M (1 CBM = 1,000 kg) is covered by consignment_calculator with mode=sea. Missing or non-positive inputs error with the failing parameter named. Rate-limited (anonymous use: 25 requests/day per IP): a 429 error body carries retry_after_seconds and a Retry-After header \u2014 back off and retry, or call get_subscribe_link for higher limits.\n\nReturns: chargeable_weight_kg, basis, volumetric_weight_kg (total and per piece), gross_weight_kg, cbm, ratio, factor and pieces under result; normalized_input echoes the interpreted inputs and any defaults applied; plus confidence, _source and citation (the FreightUtils v1 response envelope).\n\nRelated: cbm_calculator (volume only), consignment_calculator (multi-line, all modes), uld_lookup (the equipment the freight flies in).",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
 "inputSchema": {
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
   "factor": {
    "description": "Volumetric divisor in cm\u00b3/kg. Default: 6000 (IATA standard); express carriers typically 5000.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "gross_weight_kg": {
    "description": "Actual gross weight of the WHOLE shipment (all pieces) in kilograms. Example: 500.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "height_cm": {
    "description": "Height of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 100.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "length_cm": {
    "description": "Length of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 120.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   },
   "pieces": {
    "description": "Number of identical pieces. Default: 1.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "integer"
   },
   "width_cm": {
    "description": "Width of one piece in centimetres (> 0). Example: 80.",
    "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
    "type": "number"
   }
  },
  "required": [
   "length_cm",
   "width_cm",
   "height_cm",
   "gross_weight_kg"
  ],
  "type": "object"
 },
